@party_options
new-page: true

= Party Options

Configure optional details for your party.

**Party Name:** (Required)

[!
Q.new_party_name = Q.new_party_name || "";
!]

- @name_input: Set Party Name
- @name_random: Generate Random Name

**Party Leader:** (Optional)

[!
Q.new_party_leader = Q.new_party_leader || "";
!]

- @leader_input: Set Party Leader Name

**Party Description:** (Optional)

[!
Q.new_party_description = Q.new_party_description || "";
!]

- @description_input: Set Party Description

---

**Summary:**
- Name: [? if Q.new_party_name: [+ Q.new_party_name +] ?][? if not Q.new_party_name: (Not set) ?]
- Color: rgb([+ Q.party_r +], [+ Q.party_g +], [+ Q.party_b +])
- Position: [+ Q.party_position +] ([+ Q.party_ideology +])
- Leader: [? if Q.new_party_leader: [+ Q.new_party_leader +] ?][? if not Q.new_party_leader: (Not set) ?]

- @create_party: Create This Party
- @position_input: Back

@name_input

Please enter your party name:
(Note: In actual game, this would be a text input field)

- @name_example_1: Social Democratic Union
- @name_example_2: People's Alliance
- @name_example_3: Worker's Front
- @name_example_4: National Party
- @party_options: Back

