@name_random
on-arrival: {!
var adjectives = ["New", "Free", "Democratic", "Revolutionary", "Progressive", "Socialist", "National", "People's", "Workers'", "Citizens'"];
var nouns = ["Union", "Alliance", "Front", "Party", "Movement", "Coalition", "Federation", "Association", "Congress", "League"];
var adj = adjectives[Math.floor(Math.random() * adjectives.length)];
var noun = nouns[Math.floor(Math.random() * nouns.length)];
Q.new_party_name = adj + " " + noun;
!}
go-to: party_options

@leader_input

Enter a party leader name:

- @leader_example_1: Use a historical figure
- @party_options: Back

@leader_example_1

(In a full implementation, this would allow text input)

- @party_options: Back

@description_input

Enter a party description:

- @party_options: Back

@create_party
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.custom_parties) {
    Q.custom_parties = [];
}

if (!Q.new_party_name) {
    Q.new_party_name = "New Party";
}

var newParty = {
    name: Q.new_party_name,
    color: {
        r: Q.party_r || 200,
        g: Q.party_g || 50,
        b: Q.party_b || 50
    },
    position: Q.party_position || 0,
    leader: Q.new_party_leader || "",
    description: Q.new_party_description || "",
    created_at: new Date().toLocaleDateString(),
    color_hex: Q.party_color_hex || "C83232"
};

Q.custom_parties.push(newParty);

// Reset form
Q.new_party_name = "";
Q.party_position = 0;
Q.party_r = 200;
Q.party_g = 50;
Q.party_b = 50;
Q.new_party_leader = "";
Q.new_party_description = "";
!}
go-to: party_created

@party_created
new-page: true

= Party Created Successfully!

Your new party has been added to the party list.

[? if Q.custom_parties and Q.custom_parties.length > 0:
**Latest Party:**
- Name: [+ Q.custom_parties[Q.custom_parties.length - 1].name +]
- Position: [+ Q.custom_parties[Q.custom_parties.length - 1].position +]
- Ideology: [+ Q.custom_parties[Q.custom_parties.length - 1].color_hex +]
?]

- @create_basic: Create Another
- @party_list: View All Parties
- @menu: Back to Menu

@preset_parties
new-page: true

= Preset Party Templates

Choose from pre-configured parties or customize them.

**Left-Wing Presets:**

- @preset_communist: Far-Left Communist (Red #C80000)
- @preset_socialist: Left Socialist (Red #FF0000)
- @preset_center_left: Centre-Left Progressive (Orange #FF8C00)

**Center Presets:**

- @preset_center: Centre (Green #64C864)
- @preset_center_right: Centre-Right (Blue #0064C8)

**Right-Wing Presets:**

- @preset_conservative: Right Conservative (Dark Blue #003296)
- @preset_far_right: Far-Right (Gray #323232)

- @menu: Back

